From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rui Figueira <rfigueira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 21:19:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Enable anchor positioning parsing in Servo

Servo already compiles the anchor value implementations, but preference
checks reject every anchor() and anchor-size() value. The remaining
checks are crate::pref!("layout.css.anchor-positioning.enabled",
gecko = true), which is off by default in servo. Ship the parser
support unconditionally and generate the remaining anchor properties
for Servo.
---
 properties/longhands.toml    |  3 ---
 values/specified/calc.rs     |  6 ------
 values/specified/length.rs   |  9 +--------
 values/specified/position.rs | 10 ----------
 4 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 27 deletions(-)

diff --git a/properties/longhands.toml b/properties/longhands.toml
index f3c7d46..0f82a7b 100644
--- a/properties/longhands.toml
+++ b/properties/longhands.toml
@@ -182,7 +182,6 @@ affects = "layout"
